[h1]Probably MCM — Mod Configuration Menu[/h1]

Universal in-game configuration interface and developer API for [i]Probably Stolen[/i].

[b]GitHub:[/b] [url=https://github.com/GafarovMaxim/Probably-MCM]https://github.com/GafarovMaxim/Probably-MCM[/url]
[b]API Documentation:[/b] [url=https://github.com/GafarovMaxim/Probably-MCM/blob/main/Documentation.md]Documentation.md[/url]
[b]Issue Tracker:[/b] [url=https://github.com/GafarovMaxim/Probably-MCM/issues]GitHub Issues[/url]
[b]Author:[/b] Raul Moreau

